OpCode = "HALT"
Description = "HALT

Ends the program."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_wtnac"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "SET"
Description = "SET DEST IMMEDIATE

Sets a register to an immediate value.

DEST - The resister that will receive the immediate value.
IMMEDIATE - The immediate value.

SET R1 123
Sets register R1 to the value 123."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_hj4sw"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "OUT"
Description = "OUT SRC

Outputs a value from a register.

SRC - The register containing the value to output.

OUT R1
Outputs the value in register R1."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_bf41u"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "MOV"
Description = "MOV SRC DEST

Copies a value from one register to another.

SRC - The register containing the value to copy.
DEST - The register that will receive the copied value.

MOV R1 R2
Copies the value in register R1 to register R2."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_gl078"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "ADD"
Description = "ADD OP1 OP2

Adds the values in two registers together. If the sum is greater that 255, it will wrap around.

OP1 - The register containing the first operand. The result will be written to this register.
OP2 - The register containing the second operand.

ADD R1 R2
Adds the value in register R1 to the value in register R2 and stores the result in register R1."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_muqdt"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "SUB"
Description = "SUB OP1 OP2

Subtracts the values in one register from the value in another register. If the difference is less than 0, it will wrap around.

OP1 - The register containing the first operand. The result will be written to this register.
OP2 - The register containing the second operand.

SUB R1 R2
Subtracts the value in register R2 from the value in register R1 and stores the result in register R1."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_g8j2k"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "STORE"
Description = "STORE ADDR DEST

Stores the value in a register at the memory address specified by another register.

ADDR - The register containing the memory address at which to store the value.
SRC - The register containing the value to store.

STORE R1 R2
Stores the value in register R2 at the memory address specififed in register R1."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ehowj"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "LOAD"
Description = "LOAD ADDR DEST

Loads a value from a memory  address specified by a register into another register.

ADDR - The register containing the memory address from which to load the value.
DEST - The register that will receive the value.

LOAD R1 R2
Loads a value from the memory address specified specified in register R1 into register R2."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_47w6r"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "JMP"
Description = "JMP PC

Jumps to an instruction specified by a register.

PC - The register containing the instruction to jump to.

JMP R1
Jumps to the instruction in register R1."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_cfqku"]
script = ExtResource("3_y34m4")
OpCode = "JZ"
Description = "JZ PC CON

Conditionally jumps to an instruction specified in a register if another register contains the value zero.

PC - The register containing the instruction to jump to.
CON - The register containing the condition value.

JZ R1 R2
Jumps to the instruction in register R1 if register R2 contains the value zero."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ct2ddac5u21le"

